# NOTES (TODO: remove atlas and map related contents this is campaign filter)
# -- colors
# Dark  :   8  32    64  88
# Grey  :        128
# Light : 160 192   216 248
# ---- gold text color to currency background color relation (TODO: make text color appropriate and look good with backgrounds)
# Gold T5 (128  88  8) text color same as Currency LOW T2-T1 background color
# Gold T4 (160 128  8) text color same as Currency MID T3-T1 background color
# Gold T3 (192 160 32) text color same as Currency TOP T3-T3 background color
# Gold T2 (216 192 32) text color same as Currency TOP T2-T2 background color
# Gold T1 (248 216 64) text color same as Currency TOP T1-T1 background color
# Gold T2 ()
# -- sounds
# ---- starting class gem drop
# `homm3snd/starting/CstleTown.mp3`    : Scion
# `homm3snd/starting/Dungeon.mp3`      : Duelist
# `homm3snd/starting/FortressTown.mp3` : Shadow
# `homm3snd/starting/InfernoTown.mp3`  : Marauder
# `homm3snd/starting/NecroTown.mp3`    : Witch
# `homm3snd/starting/Rampart.mp3`      : Ranger
# `homm3snd/starting/StrongHold.mp3`   : Templar
# ---- items drop
# `homm3snd/ARMGEDN.wav`          : Delve Prime Resonator
# `homm3snd/Age.wav`              : Currency MID T2: Jeweller's, Chromatic and Fusing orbs, Fossils and Rogue's Marker
# `homm3snd/BADLUCK.wav`          : Unique Heavy and Leather Belt bases
# `homm3snd/BIND.wav`             : Essences low tier
# `homm3snd/BLOODLUS.wav`         : 6-Links
# `homm3snd/BUTTON.wav`           : Currency LOW T2: Portal and Wisdom Scrolls
# `homm3snd/Badmrle.wav`          : Vault Keys
# `homm3snd/Berserk.wav`          : Essences mid tier
# `homm3snd/Bless.wav`            : Sanctum Relics
# `homm3snd/Buildtwn.wav`         : Exotic Fractured items
# `homm3snd/CHEST.wav`            : Legion Timeless Emblem
# `homm3snd/COLDRAY.wav`          : Gems high quality
# `homm3snd/Chat.wav`             : Currency LOW T1 and Big Lifeforce Stacks
# `homm3snd/Cure.wav`             : some Divination Cards (TODO: review types of cards)
# `homm3snd/Curse.wav`            : Divination Cards low tier related to corrupted items
# `homm3snd/DANGER.wav`           : Error and unknown (TODO: make also disabled divination cards) divination cards
# `homm3snd/DEFAULT.wav`          : Quest Related Items (Campaign, Labirinth, Heist Targets)
# `homm3snd/Decay.wav`            : Flasks high quality
# `homm3snd/Disease.wav`          : Most Uniques and Unique Related Divination Cards
# `homm3snd/DRAGON.wav`           : Essences top tier
# `homm3snd/FAERIE.wav`           : Currency TOP T1: Tainted and other best Currency
# `homm3snd/FLAGMINE.wav`         : Currency MID T3
# `homm3snd/Forget.wav`           : Scarab Map Fragments
# `homm3snd/Fortune.wav`          : Rarity mods related identified items
# `homm3snd/GENIE.wav`            : Gem top tier and top tier gem related Divination Cards
# `homm3snd/Gazebo.wav`           : Maps tier 17 and other unknowns
# `homm3snd/GetProtection.wav`    : Essences best
# `homm3snd/Graveyard.wav`        : Expedition Logbooks
# `homm3snd/LIGHTBLT.wav`         : 5-Links
